blocks.en:
We formulate egocentric world-space hand reconstruction as direct joint generation of metric
dual-hand and camera motion instead of composing separately estimated hands and camera;
supervising the generated camera reduces rigid-aligned hand error by 6.4 6.4 mm.

blocks.zh:
我们把以自我为中心的世界-空间手重建 直接联合生成度量衡
双手和相机运动,而不是单独编组估计的手和相机;
监督生成的相机将刚性对齐的手误差减少6.4 6.4毫米.

blocks.en:
We develop a flow-matching architecture that combines geometry-aware and hand-specific video
features to jointly model wrist placement, articulation, and camera motion in a shared world frame;
replacing the geometric features with DINOv2 increases hand error by 13 13 mm and camera error by 57 57 mm.

blocks.zh:
我们开发了一种结合几何感知和手动特异性视频的流程匹配架构
在共享的世界框架内联合模拟手腕放置、发光和相机运动的特征;
将几何特征替换为DINOv2使手误增加了13个13毫米,相机误差增加了57个57毫米.

